                                "sense_id": "4763c21b-e1d1-3c6f-a9e0-f9262cdccdb0",
                                "text": "“We Norwegians are great readers,” Mrs. Nygren took the opportunity to remark.\n“And great yakkers,” Mr. Söderblad muttered."
                            }
                        ]
